<title>USA: Northwest Austin MUD 1, Texas, won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Northwest Austin MUD 1, Texas, won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker, Inc said it won $1.400 million of Northwest Austin Municipal Utility District No. 1, Texas, general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.360 percent.</p>
</text>
